  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "するどい　はで　あいてを　かみくだいて\nこうげきする。あいての　ぼうぎょを\nさげることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "날카로운 이빨로\n상대를 깨물어 부숴서 공격한다.\n상대의 방어를 떨어뜨릴 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用尖銳的牙齒咬碎對手進行攻擊。\n有時會降低對手的防禦。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur mord l’ennemi de ses crocs pointus.\nPeut aussi baisser sa Défense.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Beißt mit scharfen Reißzähnen zu und senkt eventuell\ndie Verteidigung.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tritura con afilados colmillos y puede bajar la Defensa\ndel objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Il bersaglio viene morso con denti affilati.\nPuò anche ridurne la Difesa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user crunches up the target with sharp fangs.\nThis may also lower the target’s Defense stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "鋭い　歯で\n相手を　かみくだいて　攻撃する。\n相手の　防御を　さげることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用利牙咬碎对手进行攻击。\n有时会降低对手的防御。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tritura con afilados colmillos y puede bajar la Defensa\ndel objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
